{
  "dom_id": "step-45533",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Finding the Sine or Cosine of a Special Angle Given in Radians",
  "problem": "What is the value of $\\sin \\left(\\dfrac {7\\pi} 4\\right)?$",
  "worked_solution": "Let's remind ourselves of the special trigonometric ratios, as given by the unit circle.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14250054/assets/dbf36192ac332dc49ed75278838e989a37ac7d888311be1b8b059a7b59667aa6.png)\n\nFrom the unit circle, we see that the angle $\\dfrac{7\\pi}{4}$ corresponds to the point $\\left( \\dfrac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}, -\\dfrac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\right).$\n\nSince the sine of the angle corresponds to the $y$-coordinate, we have $\\sin \\left(\\dfrac {7\\pi} 4\\right)  = -\\dfrac {\\sqrt 2} 2.$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-45533\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"45533\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"12614\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-45533\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-6\">Finding the Sine or Cosine of a Special Angle Given in Radians</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"45533\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n    